<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTALGD SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.48 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTALGD SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.48 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.48 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.74 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.87 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Sales		    9.03 vs   6.29</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.32 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.02 vs   1.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.62 vs   1.92</p>
<p> Sales		   62.34 vs  41.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Mostostal</p>
<p>Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
